@startuml GaussSeidel_Theory

skinparam backgroundColor white
skinparam sequenceArrowThickness 2
skinparam roundcorner 5
skinparam maxMessageSize 300
skinparam participantPadding 100
skinparam wrapWidth 0
skinparam maxMessageSize 500

participant "Master/\nOrchestrator" as Master
participant "SU₁" as SU1
participant "SU₂" as SU2
participant "SU₃" as SU3

== Gauss-Seidel Co-Simulation: One Macro Step tₙ → tₙ₊₁ ==

note over Master: **Sequential Execution**\nFixed order: SU₁ → SU₂ → SU₃

Master -> SU1: set u₁(tₙ) from y(tₙ₋₁)
activate SU1
note right: Uses old outputs\nfrom previous step
SU1 --> Master: inputs set
deactivate SU1

Master -> SU1: doStep(tₙ, H)
activate SU1
SU1 -> SU1: x₁ⁿ⁺¹ = δ₁(tₙ, x₁ⁿ, u₁ⁿ)
SU1 -> SU1: y₁ⁿ⁺¹ = λ₁(tₙ₊₁, x₁ⁿ⁺¹)
SU1 --> Master: outputs y₁(tₙ₊₁)
deactivate SU1

note over Master: y₁(tₙ₊₁) now available

Master -> SU2: set u₂(tₙ) from y₁(tₙ₊₁), y₃(tₙ₋₁)
activate SU2
note right: Uses updated y₁ⁿ⁺¹\nand old y₃ⁿ⁻¹
SU2 --> Master: inputs set
deactivate SU2

Master -> SU2: doStep(tₙ, H)
activate SU2
SU2 -> SU2: x₂ⁿ⁺¹ = δ₂(tₙ, x₂ⁿ, u₂ⁿ)
SU2 -> SU2: y₂ⁿ⁺¹ = λ₂(tₙ₊₁, x₂ⁿ⁺¹)
SU2 --> Master: outputs y₂(tₙ₊₁)
deactivate SU2

note over Master: y₂(tₙ₊₁) now available

Master -> SU3: set u₃(tₙ) from y₁(tₙ₊₁), y₂(tₙ₊₁)
activate SU3
note right: Uses updated y₁ⁿ⁺¹, y₂ⁿ⁺¹\nfrom current step
SU3 --> Master: inputs set
deactivate SU3

Master -> SU3: doStep(tₙ, H)
activate SU3
SU3 -> SU3: x₃ⁿ⁺¹ = δ₃(tₙ, x₃ⁿ, u₃ⁿ)
SU3 -> SU3: y₃ⁿ⁺¹ = λ₃(tₙ₊₁, x₃ⁿ⁺¹)
SU3 --> Master: outputs y₃(tₙ₊₁)
deactivate SU3

Master -> Master: All outputs at tₙ₊₁ available
note right: Ready for next macro step

@enduml